Comment=Not shipped in the opensource tip — install the official closed release for Studio/daemon
Comment[en]=Not shipped in the opensource tip — install the official closed release for Studio/daemon
Comment[en_US]=Not shipped in the opensource tip — install the official closed release for Studio/daemon
Comment[zh]=开源 tip 不附带 Studio/daemon，请使用官方闭源发行物
